      "description_html": "<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<p class=\"content body s\">With the open air lounger and flexible bench from the Tia collection, Antonino Sciortino reinvents the fundamental style of outdoor design, elevating simplicity into pure elegance. The rounded lines, sculpted in matt black stainless steel rod, give this furniture a surprising visual lightness, while maintaining a clean structural solidity. With their circular design, the seats form a distinctive element of the collection, wrapping around and defining each item. This imparts a unique identity to the furniture, counterbalancing the sharp linearity of the structure. These pieces seamlessly blend into any outdoor setting, untroubled by seasonal changes, while preserving an enduring sense of harmony and lightness.</p>\n<p class=\"content body s\"> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
