      "description_html": "<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<div class=\"ProductTop top\">\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"about\">\n<p class=\"content body s\">The Rimini collection of sun loungers, chaise longues and ottomans by Paola Navone pays tribute to the quintessential Italian summer ambiance reminiscent of Fellini. With timeless elegance, the Rimini sun loungers encapsulate the carefree spirit of an Italian holiday with their refined and versatile design, perfect for gardens and poolside areas. In the Outdoor, each piece is characterised by a seat in durable Aku leather, suspended on a tubular structure in exclusive verdigris acid-etched copper. The Open-Air, on the other hand, features a Hydro leather seat that wraps around the body and supports it thanks to the acid-etched copper structure. The seat decorations differ based on the version and serve as an additional distinguishing feature: in the Lido leather version, the visible stitching conveys understated elegance, while in the Outdoor fabric version, the decorative piping — available in either solid or contrasting colours — provides the opportunity to personalise each seat's look with a broad range of colours.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbar\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<div class=\"cta\">\n<div class=\"\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
